unmatched orders, and amount

80
00:06:58.909 --> 00:07:03.000
reconciliation.

81
00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:07.167
Checkpoint. The order table has one
thousand three hundred rows.

82
00:07:07.167 --> 00:07:11.333
The customer table has one thousand rows.
After joining on

83
00:07:11.333 --> 00:07:15.500
customer name, the result has one thousand
six hundred fifty

84
00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:19.667
rows. The generated explanation says the
