87
00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:32.273
The explanation is not sufficient.
Multiple orders already exist as

88
00:08:32.273 --> 00:08:36.545
separate order rows; they do not by
themselves explain why

89
00:08:36.545 --> 00:08:40.818
a join created three hundred fifty
additional rows. Inspect the

90
00:08:40.818 --> 00:08:45.091
grain and uniqueness of both keys.
Customer name may be

91
00:08:45.091 --> 00:08:49.364
